            "start_line": 27,
            "end_line": 29,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// -d is an unrecognized (\"rogue\") option; arg1 and arg2 are plain arguments. final String[] args = {\"-a\", \"-b\", \"-c\", \"-d\", \"arg1\", \"arg2\"}; final DefaultParser parser = new DefaultParser();"
